  <p><span class="cl">12.3</span> A Force Majeure event will be grounds for termination of the Engagement if it remains in effect for more than {{ terms.force_majeure_days }} days, or if it will clearly result in a party being unable to perform its obligations under these Terms of Engagement for more than {{ terms.force_majeure_days }} days. A party terminating the Engagement due to a Force Majeure event will not incur any liability to the other party, except for payment obligations accrued for Services rendered before the Force Majeure event began.</p>

